# Expense Claims — Acceptance Test Cases (User Journeys)

> Scope: functional / acceptance testing of the **Expense Claims** feature (mysdworx app), requester + approver perspectives, with an emphasis on **cross-role end-to-end journeys** (a requester action changes what the approver sees, and vice versa).
> Sources: `Claim_FunctionalDoc_Requester`, `Claim_FunctionalDoc_Approver`, `Claim_APIdoc`, `Claim_APIrequests.json`, and `../../.github/copilot-instructions.md`.
> Execution: manual-assisted; deterministic variants forced via **HTTP Toolkit** response mocking; evidence via the **adb** screenshot pipeline (see `.github/copilot-instructions.md`).

---

## Legend & conventions
- **Priority:** P1 = critical happy path / core rule, P2 = important variant, P3 = edge/negative.
- **[MOCK]** = requires an HTTP Toolkit Modify rule to force a backend response/flag/error.
- **[2-ROLE]** = needs switching between requester and approver account (both available).
- **(gap)** = behaviour not fully specified in the wiki — verify empirically and record the actual result.
- State names: **Draft**, **Rejected**, **Pending** (submitted/awaiting approval), **Approved**.

## Test accounts & data
| Role | Account | Notes |
|--|--|--|
| Requester | employee test account | Can create claims/expenses, link/unlink, submit. |
| Approver | manager test account | Has approval rights for expense claims; is the requester's approver. |

Recommended baseline data before a run:
- At least **2 unassigned expenses** available to the requester.
- At least **1 Draft claim** (empty) and **1 Draft claim with ≥2 expenses**.
- Approver inbox reachable (Pending Approvals tile visible).

## Variant matrix (apply to journeys as noted)
| Dimension | Values |
|--|--|
| Claim state | Draft / Rejected / Pending / Approved |
| # expenses on claim | 0 / 1 / many |
| Currency | single / multi-currency / foreign-converted |
| Approve comment config (`approveCommentUse`) | Mandatory / Optional / Prohibited |
| Reject comment config (`rejectionCommentUse`) | Mandatory / Optional / Prohibited |
| Approver entry point | Overview inline / Notification / App inbox / Claim detail |
| Reject scope | Full (overview/notif/inbox) / Partial (detail only) |
| Backend flags | `canEdit`, `canDelete`, `canUnlinkExpenses`, `canLinkExpenses`, `canViewDetails`, `supportsExpenseLinking` |
| Error injection | backend error / network / HTTP 4xx / HTTP 5xx |

